      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be very useful. I've got a dress that I love to be able to pick up the sides of but if I enable grabbing then others are able to flip it up. I know I could just pause it but then that would mean all other interactable features I have setup on my avatar would also be caught in the crossfire.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
