  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-25T10:36:33.165Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now if I use parameters like _IsGrabbed, I Will get it to where everyone will be able to perform the action that was only meant to work for me. Currently I been adding bat's and various items to my avatar, and using _isgrabbed to simply parent constraint it to my hands. But since others can interact with them, it's scuffed and a bit annoying.\n\nI would love to see the options of both Phys Bones and Contact Points to be more similar as they are both being used for similar things. Having no good way to only make it work for the owner of the avatar on phys Bones sucks when it works well on Contact points. Please add permission settings to the parameter side of Phys Bones like you have to Contact Points!",
